const initialHistory=[{title:'已保存个人求职档案',detail:'目标：上海 · 产品运营 · 每周 4 天 · 3 个月',time:'今天 09:20'},{title:'已整理示例搜索结果',detail:'10 个示例岗位，等待用户选择是否加入岗位池',time:'今天 09:25'},{title:'已记录面试进度',detail:'轻舟智能 · AI 应用运营实习生',time:'昨天 14:30'}];
let STORAGE='internpilot-ui-v1';
function fresh(){return {profile:structuredClone(initialProfile),jobs:demoJobs.map(j=>({...structuredClone(j),inPool:Boolean(j.saved||j.status!=='pending'),archived:false,sourceKey:'demo:'+j.id,source:'招聘平台示例'})),poolSchema:1,resultIds:demoJobs.map(j=>j.id),history:structuredClone(initialHistory),settings:{scenario:'normal',compact:false},messages:[],onboarded:false}}
let state=fresh();try{const x=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(STORAGE));if(x&&Array.isArray(x.jobs)&&x.profile){state={...fresh(),...x};state.poolSchema=x.poolSchema??0;state.jobs=state.jobs.filter(j=>j&&Number.isFinite(j.id)&&typeof j.title==='string'&&typeof j.company==='string');}}catch{}
function defaultFilters(tab='all'){return {q:'',city:'全部城市',role:'全部方向',days:'不限',tab,status:'all',match:'all',sort:'score'}}
let page='dashboard',filter=defaultFilters(),selected=new Set(),drawerJob=null,drawerTab='match',modal=null,chatOpen=false,chatContext=null,onboardStep=1,onboardDraft={},task={running:false,step:0,status:'idle'},taskTimer=null,lastUndo=null,toastTimer=null,greetingStyle='natural',searchDraft=null;
const pageNames={dashboard:'工作台',discover:'搜索结果',pool:'我的岗位池',favorites:'我的岗位池',applications:'我的投递',profile:'个人档案',activity:'历史活动',settings:'设置',design:'设计说明'};
function save(){try{localStorage.setItem(STORAGE,JSON.stringify(state));return true}catch{toast('浏览器保存失败，请检查存储空间。');return false}}
function addHistory(title,detail=''){state.history.unshift({title,detail,time:nowLabel()});state.history=state.history.slice(0,100);return save()}
function nowLabel(){return new Date().toLocaleString('zh-CN',{month:'2-digit',day:'2-digit',hour:'2-digit',minute:'2-digit'})}
function today(){const d=new Date();return `${d.getFullYear()}-${String(d.getMonth()+1).padStart(2,'0')}-${String(d.getDate()).padStart(2,'0')}`}
function job(id){return state.jobs.find(x=>x.id===Number(id))}
function effectiveScore(j){return j.score}
function conflicts(j){let a=[];if(j.city!==state.profile.city)a.push('城市');if(j.days>Number(state.profile.days))a.push('到岗天数');if(j.months>Number(state.profile.months))a.push('实习时长');return a}
function scoreLabel(j){return conflicts(j).length?'条件待核对':effectiveScore(j)>=85?'优先考虑':'可以了解'}
function statusTag(s){return `<span class="status ${esc(s)}">${statuses[s]||'待投递'}</span>`}
function toast(message,undo){clearTimeout(toastTimer);document.getElementById('toast-root').innerHTML=`<div class="toast"><span>${esc(message)}</span>${undo?'<button onclick="undoLast()">撤销</button>':''}<button aria-label="关闭提示" onclick="clearToast()">×</button></div>`;toastTimer=setTimeout(clearToast,6000)}
function clearToast(){document.getElementById('toast-root').innerHTML=''}
function nav(p){const savedView=p==='favorites';page=savedView?'pool':p;selected.clear();filter=defaultFilters();if(savedView)filter.archive='saved';document.querySelector('.sidebar')?.classList.remove('open');render();window.scrollTo({top:0,behavior:'smooth'})}
function render(){document.title=`${pageNames[page]} · InternPilot`;document.getElementById('app').innerHTML=`<div class="shell"><aside class="sidebar">${sidebar()}</aside><div class="app-body"><header class="topbar"><div class="breadcrumb"><button class="icon-btn mobile-menu" aria-label="打开导航" onclick="document.querySelector('.sidebar').classList.toggle('open')">${icon('menu')}</button><span>我的空间</span>${icon('chevron')}<b>${pageNames[page]}</b></div><div class="top-actions"><span class="demo-tag">交互原型 · 演示数据</span><button class="global-search" onclick="openSearch()" aria-label="搜索岗位">${icon('search')}<span>搜索岗位、公司</span><kbd class="kbd">⌘ K</kbd></button><button class="icon-btn" aria-label="待办提醒" onclick="openNotices()">${icon('bell')}<i class="dot"></i></button>${accountControl()}</div></header><div class="workspace"><main class="content">${({dashboard:dashboard,discover:discover,pool:poolPage,applications:applications,profile:profilePage,activity:activityPage,settings:settingsPage,design:designPage}[page]||dashboard)()}</main>${assistant()}</div></div></div><button class="chat-toggle" aria-label="打开求职助手" onclick="toggleChat(true)">${icon('spark')}</button>`;bindChat();scrollChat();}
function accountControl(){return `<button class="account-control" onclick="openAccountMenu()" aria-label="账号菜单，切换账号或退出登录"><span class="avatar">${esc(state.profile.name.slice(-1))}</span><span class="account-control-name">${esc(state.profile.name)}</span>${icon('down')}</button>`}
function head(title,sub,action=''){return `<div class="page-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">YOUR NEXT CHAPTER</div><h1>${title}</h1><p>${sub}</p></div>${action}</div>`}
function empty(title,sub,label,action){return `<div class="empty" style="grid-column:1/-1">${icon('search')}<h3>${title}</h3><p>${sub}</p>${label?`<button class="button soft" onclick="${action}">${label}</button>`:''}</div>`}
function setTab(t){filter.tab=t;selected.clear();render()}
function setFilter(k,v){filter[k]=v;selected.clear();render()}
function changeQuery(v){filter.q=v;selected.clear();clearTimeout(window.queryTimer);window.queryTimer=setTimeout(()=>{const input=document.activeElement;const pos=input?.selectionStart;render();const el=document.querySelector('[data-filter-search]');el?.focus();if(pos!=null)el?.setSelectionRange(pos,pos)},260)}
function filterSelect(key,label,options){return `<label class="filter-field"><span>${label}</span><select class="select" aria-label="${label}" onchange="setFilter('${key}',this.value)">${options.map(([v,t])=>`<option value="${esc(v)}" ${v===filter[key]?'selected':''}>${esc(t)}</option>`).join('')}</select></label>`}
function filtersBar(){const all=v=>v.map(t=>[t,t]);return `<section class="filters job-filters" aria-label="岗位筛选"><label class="filter-field filter-query"><span>关键词</span><input class="input" data-filter-search placeholder="搜索岗位名称、公司或技能" aria-label="搜索岗位" value="${esc(filter.q)}" oninput="changeQuery(this.value)"></label>${filterSelect('city','城市',all(['全部城市',...new Set(state.jobs.map(j=>j.city).filter(Boolean))]))}${filterSelect('role','岗位方向',all(['全部方向',...new Set(state.jobs.map(j=>j.role).filter(Boolean))]))}${filterSelect('days','每周到岗',[['不限','到岗不限'],['3','最多 3 天/周'],['4','最多 4 天/周'],['5','最多 5 天/周']])}${filterSelect('match','匹配情况',[['all','全部匹配情况'],['priority','优先考虑（85+，无条件冲突）'],['conflict','存在条件冲突'],['unknown','能力证据待补充']])}${page==='applications'?'':filterSelect('status','投递状态',[['all','全部状态'],...Object.entries(statuses)])}${filterSelect('sort','排序方式',[['score','匹配分数从高到低'],['saved','最近收藏优先']])}<div class="filter-reset"><button class="link-btn" onclick="resetFilters()">${icon('refresh')}清除筛选</button></div></section>${filterChips()}`}
function filterChips(){const labels={city:filter.city,role:filter.role,days:`最多 ${filter.days} 天/周`,status:statuses[filter.status],match:{priority:'优先考虑',conflict:'存在条件冲突',unknown:'能力证据待补充'}[filter.match],q:`关键词：${filter.q}`};const defaults=defaultFilters();const keys=['q','city','role','days','match','status'].filter(k=>filter[k]&&filter[k]!==defaults[k]);return keys.length?`<div class="filter-chips" aria-label="当前筛选条件"><span>正在筛选</span>${keys.map(k=>`<button class="filter-chip" aria-label="移除${esc(labels[k])}筛选" onclick="setFilter('${k}','${defaults[k]}')">${esc(labels[k])}${icon('close')}</button>`).join('')}</div>`:''}
function selectedVisibleJobs(){return visibleJobs().filter(j=>selected.has(j.id))}
function selectJob(id,v){v?selected.add(id):selected.delete(id);render()}
function selectAll(v){visibleJobs().forEach(j=>v?selected.add(j.id):selected.delete(j.id));render()}
function savedButton(j){return `<button class="bookmark-btn ${j.saved?'saved':''}" data-save-job="${j.id}" aria-label="${j.saved?'取消收藏':'收藏'}${esc(j.title)}" aria-pressed="${Boolean(j.saved)}" onclick="toggleSaved(${j.id})">${icon('bookmark')}<span>${j.saved?'已收藏':'收藏'}</span></button>`}
function refreshCollections(){render();for(const el of document.querySelectorAll?.('[data-save-job]')||[]){const j=job(el.dataset.saveJob);if(!j)continue;el.className=`bookmark-btn ${j.saved?'saved':''}`;el.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(Boolean(j.saved)));el.setAttribute('aria-label',`${j.saved?'取消收藏':'收藏'}${j.title}`);el.innerHTML=`${icon('bookmark')}<span>${j.saved?'已收藏':'收藏'}</span>`}}
function profileFields(p){return `<div class="field"><label>称呼</label><input class="input" name="name" value="${esc(p.name)}" required maxlength="20"></div><div class="field"><label>当前身份</label><select class="select" name="education">${['本科在读','硕士在读','博士在读','应届毕业生'].map(v=>`<option ${p.education===v?'selected':''}>${v}</option>`).join('')}</select></div><div class="field"><label>目标方向</label><input class="input" name="direction" value="${esc(p.direction)}" maxlength="80" required placeholder="例如：研发、设计、财务、教育、运营"></div><div class="field"><label>意向城市</label><select class="select" name="city">${['上海','北京','杭州'].map(v=>`<option ${p.city===v?'selected':''}>${v}</option>`).join('')}</select></div><div class="field"><label>每周可到岗天数</label><select class="select" name="days">${[2,3,4,5].map(v=>`<option value="${v}" ${Number(p.days)===v?'selected':''}>${v} 天</option>`).join('')}</select></div><div class="field"><label>可持续实习时长</label><select class="select" name="months">${[2,3,4,6].map(v=>`<option value="${v}" ${Number(p.months)===v?'selected':''}>${v} 个月</option>`).join('')}</select></div><div class="field wide"><label>最早到岗日期</label><input type="date" class="input" name="start" required value="${esc(p.start)}"></div>`}
function saveProfile(e){e.preventDefault();const f=new FormData(e.target),p={...state.profile};for(const k of ['name','education','direction','city','days','months','start','resume'])if(f.has(k))p[k]=String(f.get(k)).trim();if(!p.name){toast('请填写称呼');return}const previous=structuredClone(state);archiveProfile(state.profile);state.profile={...p,days:Number(p.days),months:Number(p.months),updated:today()};if(!addHistory('已更新个人档案',`${p.city} · ${p.direction} · 每周 ${p.days} 天`)){state=previous;return}render();toast('档案已保存，岗位条件判断已更新。')}
function useExampleResume(){state.profile.resume=initialProfile.resume;state.profile.resumeName=initialProfile.resumeName;save();render();toast('已填入示例简历，可继续编辑并保存。')}
function handleResume(f){if(!f)return;const ext=f.name.split('.').pop().toLowerCase();if(!['pdf','docx','md','txt'].includes(ext)){toast('请选择 PDF、Word、Markdown 或文本文件');return}if(f.size>10*1024*1024){toast('请选择小于 10 MB 的文件');return}if(['md','txt'].includes(ext)){const reader=new FileReader();reader.onload=()=>{const el=document.getElementById('resume-text');if(el)el.value=String(reader.result);state.profile.resumeName=f.name;toast('文字已读入编辑框，请核对后保存。')};reader.readAsText(f)}else{toast(`已选择 ${f.name}。原型保留示例内容，未上传或解析此文件。`)}}
function activityPage(){return `${head('历史活动','保留每一次确认、更新和状态变化。')}<section class="panel"><div class="timeline">${state.history.map(h=>`<div class="timeline-item"><strong>${esc(h.title)}</strong><div style="font-size:10px;margin:4px 0;color:#a49bb0">${esc(h.detail)}</div><small>${esc(h.time)}</small></div>`).join('')}</div></section>`}
function settingsPage(){return `${head('设置','管理原型偏好、数据与演示状态。')}<section class="panel"><h3>工作空间</h3><div class="settings-row"><div><strong>当前模式</strong><p>所有岗位、搜索进度和对话回复均为本地演示。</p></div><span class="tag purple">交互原型</span></div><div class="settings-row"><div><strong>当前岗位来源</strong><p>用于展示单平台接入流程，不会连接招聘账号。</p></div><span class="tag">招聘平台 · 示例</span></div><div class="settings-row"><div><strong>投递状态更新</strong><p>由用户完成原平台投递后，手动单个或批量标记。</p></div><span class="tag green">用户确认</span></div></section><section class="panel" style="margin-top:15px"><h3>异常与空状态演示</h3><div class="settings-row"><div><strong>下一次搜索的结果</strong><p>选择后，点击“新建岗位搜索”查看对应交互。</p></div><select class="select" onchange="state.settings.scenario=this.value;save();toast('已切换演示场景')">${[['normal','正常完成'],['login','登录状态失效'],['empty','暂无搜索结果'],['model','匹配分析失败']].map(([v,n])=>`<option value="${v}" ${state.settings.scenario===v?'selected':''}>${n}</option>`).join('')}</select></div><div class="settings-row"><div><strong>保存失败演示</strong><p>体验状态更新失败后保留旧记录的交互。</p></div><button class="button small" onclick="state.settings.failSave=true;toast('下一次投递状态保存将模拟失败')">触发一次</button></div><div class="settings-row"><div><strong>查看首次使用流程</strong><p>求职条件 → 简历材料 → 核对并开始。</p></div><button class="button small soft" onclick="openOnboarding()">打开引导</button></div></section><section class="panel" style="margin-top:15px"><h3>数据管理</h3><div class="settings-row"><div><strong>浏览器本地存储</strong><p>可保存档案、收藏、文案与申请状态；请使用示例材料体验。</p></div>${icon('shield')}</div><div class="settings-row"><div><strong>恢复初始演示数据</strong><p>会清空本原型内的编辑记录，并恢复示例岗位。</p></div><button class="button small danger" onclick="openReset()">重置演示</button></div></section>`}
function designPage(){return `${head('设计说明','一套围绕真实求职任务组织的界面与交互规范。')}<section class="panel"><h3>信息架构</h3><div class="mini-flow">${['工作台 / 进展与待办','搜索结果 / 初筛与选择','岗位详情 / 证据与原文','求职助手 / 上下文对话','我的岗位池 / 增加与归档、我的投递 / 实际状态','个人档案 / 偏好与证据'].map(x=>`<span>${x}</span>`).join('')}</div><p class="muted" style="font-size:11px">右侧助手跨页面保留上下文。岗位卡片负责快速决策，详情抽屉承载核查，确认后再更改个人档案与投递状态。</p></section><section class="panel" style="margin-top:15px"><h3>四条完整使用路径</h3>${[['1','首次使用','打开使用引导 → 填写条件 → 使用示例简历 → 核对搜索方案'],['2','发现并筛选','新建搜索 → 查看初筛结果 → 选择加入岗位池 → 标记重点收藏 → 打开匹配证据'],['3','补充与沟通','针对岗位提问 → 补充能力事实 → 确认更新 → 生成、编辑、复制招呼语'],['4','投递与复盘','在原平台手动投递 → 勾选岗位 → 批量标记 → 查看记录并支持撤销']].map(([a,b,c])=>`<div class="evidence-item"><strong>${a}. ${b}</strong><small>${c}</small></div>`).join('')}</section><section class="panel" style="margin-top:15px"><h3>视觉规范</h3><div class="design-palette">${[['#6754df','主色 / 操作'],['#f0edff','辅助 / 选中'],['#22977c','已满足'],['#ba8638','待确认'],['#d5656e','冲突'],['#f7f8fc','页面底色']].map(([c,t])=>`<div class="swatch" style="background:${c};color:${['#6754df','#22977c','#d5656e','#ba8638'].includes(c)?'#fff':'#9a91ab'}">${t}<br>${c}</div>`).join('')}</div><p class="muted" style="font-size:11px">间距以 4 / 8 为基础，卡片圆角 12–16，主次按钮区分；桌面常驻助手，窄屏以浮动按钮打开；状态同时使用文字与颜色表达。</p></section><section class="panel" style="margin-top:15px"><h3>边界与异常状态</h3><div class="completed-row">${icon('check')} 空列表：保留筛选条件，提供清除与重新搜索入口</div><div class="completed-row">${icon('check')} 采集受阻：说明原因、由用户处理，提供重试和停止</div><div class="completed-row">${icon('check')} 信息不足：追问或跳过，保留“待确认”标记</div><div class="completed-row">${icon('check')} 匹配失败：保留岗位，允许单独重试分析</div><div class="completed-row">${icon('check')} 保存失败：保留旧状态，允许再次提交</div><div class="completed-row">${icon('check')} 误操作：投递状态支持撤销，个人档案支持恢复版本</div><div class="completed-row">${icon('check')} 范围：不包含简历撰写、自动投递和 HR 回复监测</div></section>`}

function toggleChat(v){chatOpen=v;document.querySelector('.assistant')?.classList.toggle('mobile-open',v);if(v)document.getElementById('chat-input')?.focus()}
function scrollChat(){const m=document.getElementById('messages');if(m)m.scrollTop=m.scrollHeight}
function confirmDays(n){const old=structuredClone(state.profile);state.versions=[{profile:old,time:nowLabel()},...(state.versions||[])].slice(0,8);state.profile.days=n;state.profile.updated=today();state.messages=state.messages.map(m=>m.action==='days'?{...m,action:null}:m);state.messages.push({role:'assistant',text:'已更新为每周最多到岗 3 天。所有岗位的到岗条件已重新核对，原投递状态保持不变。'});addHistory('已更新到岗条件','每周最多 3 天，重新核对全部岗位');render();toast('求职条件已更新')}

function showModal(html,wide=false){document.getElementById('overlay-root').innerHTML=`<div class="modal-backdrop" onclick="if(event.target===this)closeOverlay()"><section class="modal ${wide?'wide':''}" role="dialog" aria-modal="true">${html}</section></div>`;document.body.style.overflow='hidden';setTimeout(()=>document.querySelector('.modal input,.modal select,.modal button')?.focus(),40)}
function modalHead(title,sub){return `<div class="modal-head"><div><h2>${title}</h2>${sub?`<p>${sub}</p>`:''}</div><button class="icon-btn" aria-label="关闭弹窗" onclick="closeOverlay()">${icon('close')}</button></div>`}
function openOnboarding(){onboardStep=1;onboardDraft={...state.profile};renderOnboarding()}
function renderOnboarding(){modal='onboarding';showModal(`${modalHead('让助手更了解你','先提供真实信息，再开始寻找适合的实习。')}<div class="steps">${['求职条件','经历材料','核对并开始'].map((n,i)=>`<div class="step ${i+1===onboardStep?'active':i+1<onboardStep?'done':''}">0${i+1} · ${n}</div>`).join('')}</div><form onsubmit="nextOnboarding(event)">${onboardStep===1?`<div class="form-grid">${profileFields(onboardDraft)}</div>`:onboardStep===2?`<div class="info-note">${icon('file')}<span>先使用示例材料体验完整流程，后续可在个人档案中编辑文字事实。</span></div><div class="field"><label>经历材料</label><textarea class="input" name="resume" style="min-height:200px" required>${esc(onboardDraft.resume)}</textarea><small>请只填写真实经历。此原型建议保留示例材料。</small></div>`:`<div class="confirmation-list"><div><small>目标方向</small>${esc(onboardDraft.direction)}</div><div><small>意向城市</small>${esc(onboardDraft.city)}</div><div><small>到岗安排</small>每周 ${onboardDraft.days} 天</div><div><small>持续时长</small>${onboardDraft.months} 个月</div><div><small>最早到岗</small>${esc(onboardDraft.start)}</div><div><small>材料</small>已填写经历文字</div></div><div class="info-note">${icon('shield')}<span>完成设置后将进入工作台。岗位搜索需由你另行启动；投递始终由你在原平台完成。</span></div>`}<div class="footer"><button class="button" type="button" onclick="${onboardStep===1?'closeOverlay()':'onboardStep--;renderOnboarding()'}">${onboardStep===1?'稍后设置':'上一步'}</button><button class="button primary" type="submit">${onboardStep===3?'保存并进入工作台':'下一步'}${icon('arrow')}</button></div></form>`)}
function nextOnboarding(e){e.preventDefault();const f=new FormData(e.target);for(const [k,v]of f)onboardDraft[k]=String(v).trim();if(onboardStep<3){onboardStep++;renderOnboarding()}else{state.profile={...onboardDraft,days:Number(onboardDraft.days),months:Number(onboardDraft.months),updated:today()};state.onboarded=true;addHistory('已完成首次建档',`${onboardDraft.city} · ${onboardDraft.direction}`);closeOverlay();nav('dashboard');toast('档案已保存，可以开始体验岗位搜索。')}}
function openSearchConfig(){if(task.running){openTask();return}modal='search';const p=searchDraft||state.profile;showModal(`${modalHead('寻找下一份实习','先确认搜索范围，助手会为你整理岗位与匹配依据。')}<form onsubmit="startSearch(event)"><div class="form-grid"><div class="field wide"><label>想找什么岗位？</label><input class="input" name="direction" value="${esc(p.direction)}" required placeholder="例如：产品运营、AI 产品实习" maxlength="80"></div><div class="field"><label>城市</label><select class="select" name="city">${['上海','北京','杭州'].map(c=>`<option ${p.city===c?'selected':''}>${c}</option>`).join('')}</select></div><div class="field"><label>岗位来源</label><select class="select" name="source"><option>招聘平台 · 演示来源</option></select></div><div class="field"><label>每周最多到岗</label><select class="select" name="days">${[2,3,4,5].map(n=>`<option value="${n}" ${Number(p.days)===n?'selected':''}>${n} 天</option>`).join('')}</select></div><div class="field"><label>可持续时长</label><select class="select" name="months">${[2,3,4,6].map(n=>`<option value="${n}" ${Number(p.months)===n?'selected':''}>${n} 个月</option>`).join('')}</select></div></div><div class="info-note">${icon('info')}<span>此处演示“确认条件—获取岗位—整理—匹配”的交互。使用合成岗位数据，不会打开招聘平台或读取登录状态。</span></div><div class="footer"><button class="button" type="button" onclick="closeOverlay()">取消</button><button class="button primary" type="submit">${icon('search')}确认并开始搜索</button></div></form>`)}
function startSearch(e){if(e)e.preventDefault();if(e){const f=new FormData(e.target);searchDraft={direction:f.get('direction'),city:f.get('city'),days:Number(f.get('days')),months:Number(f.get('months'))}}if(task.running)return;clearInterval(taskTimer);task={running:true,step:0,status:'running',scenario:state.settings.scenario||'normal',started:Date.now()};addHistory('已启动岗位搜索演示',`${searchDraft?.city||state.profile.city} · ${searchDraft?.direction||state.profile.direction}`);openTask();taskTimer=setInterval(()=>{if(!task.running){clearInterval(taskTimer);return}task.step++;if(task.scenario==='login'&&task.step===1){task.running=false;task.status='blocked';clearInterval(taskTimer)}else if(task.scenario==='model'&&task.step===3){task.running=false;task.status='model-error';clearInterval(taskTimer)}else if(task.scenario==='empty'&&task.step===2){task.running=false;task.status=storeSearchResults([])?'empty':'save-error';clearInterval(taskTimer)}else if(task.step>=4){task.running=false;clearInterval(taskTimer);task.status=storeSearchResults(demoJobs)?'done':'save-error'}if(modal==='task')openTask();else render()},700)}
function stopTask(){task.running=false;task.status='cancelled';clearInterval(taskTimer);addHistory('已停止搜索任务','保留已有岗位与记录');openTask()}
function retryTask(){task.scenario='normal';const old=state.settings.scenario;state.settings.scenario='normal';startSearch();state.settings.scenario=old}
function retryAnalysis(){task.running=true;task.status='running';task.step=3;openTask();clearInterval(taskTimer);taskTimer=setTimeout(()=>{task.running=false;task.step=4;task.status=storeSearchResults(demoJobs)?'done':'save-error';addHistory('已重试匹配分析','复用已整理的示例岗位，不自动加入岗位池');if(modal==='task')openTask()},900)}

function evidenceCard(title,jd,proof,status,color,note,action){return `<div class="evidence-card"><div class="evidence-head"><strong>${title}</strong><span class="tag ${color}">${status}</span></div><div class="evidence-label">岗位要求 · 示例原文</div><div class="evidence-quote">${esc(jd)}</div><div class="evidence-label">个人证据 · 示例简历 / 用户确认</div><div class="evidence-quote">${esc(proof)}</div><p class="evidence-note">${esc(note)}</p>${action?`<button class="link-btn" style="margin-top:9px" onclick="${action}">补充信息 ${icon('arrow')}</button>`:''}</div>`}
function sourceJdDetail(j){return `<div class="info-note">${icon('info')}<span>这是为 UI 设计构建的合成 JD，非真实在招岗位。正式产品将在这里保留来源链接、平台名称与获取时间。</span></div><div class="tags"><span class="tag">获取时间：2026-10-19 · 演示</span><span class="tag">来源：招聘平台示例</span></div><div class="jd-body"><h3>岗位职责</h3><ul><li>参与${j.role}相关工作，整理用户或业务反馈。</li><li>协助收集信息、分析问题，并与团队沟通改进建议。</li><li>完成日常数据整理、内容研究和项目进度记录。</li></ul><h3>任职要求</h3><ul><li>本科或硕士在读，每周到岗 ${j.days} 天，可持续 ${j.months} 个月。</li><li>具备清晰的表达与信息整理能力，有相关项目者优先。</li><li>${j.sql?'掌握 SQL 基础查询，能够支持日常分析。':'对用户研究和产品体验有兴趣，能说明个人贡献。'}</li><li>工作地点：${j.city}；日薪 ${j.pay}。</li></ul><h3>补充说明</h3><p>“有相关项目者优先”属于加分条件，不应直接视为必备门槛。正式岗位的到岗时间、是否可协商等信息，需要以招聘方说明为准。</p></div>`}
function makeGreeting(j,style='natural'){const intro=style==='formal'?'您好，我希望申请贵公司的':'您好，想了解一下';return `${intro}${j.title}。我做过用户评论分类与资料整理项目，使用 Python 归纳反馈问题并输出结果表，希望将这些实践用于${j.role}工作。我目前可每周到岗 ${state.profile.days} 天、持续 ${state.profile.months} 个月，${style==='short'?'期待进一步沟通。':'方便进一步了解岗位的具体要求吗？'}`}
function greetingDetail(j){return `${j.greeting?'':'<div class="info-note">'+icon('spark')+'<span>下方为基于示例简历与 JD 的文案草稿，请核实后编辑。原型使用本地模板演示生成过程。</span></div>'}<div class="section-head"><h2>为这个岗位准备的开场白</h2><span class="tag">仅供用户复制</span></div><div class="greeting-options">${[['natural','自然简洁'],['formal','正式礼貌'],['short','更短一些']].map(([v,n])=>`<button class="${greetingStyle===v?'active':''}" onclick="setGreetingStyle(${j.id},'${v}')">${n}</button>`).join('')}</div><textarea class="input textarea-large" id="greeting-text" maxlength="500" oninput="document.getElementById('greeting-count').textContent=this.value.length">${esc(j.greeting||makeGreeting(j,greetingStyle))}</textarea><div class="char-count"><span id="greeting-count">${(j.greeting||makeGreeting(j,greetingStyle)).length}</span> / 500 字符</div><div class="inline" style="margin-top:13px"><button class="button" onclick="saveGreeting(${j.id})">保存修改</button><button class="button" onclick="regenerateGreeting(${j.id})">${icon('refresh')}重新生成</button><button class="button soft" onclick="copyGreeting(${j.id})">${icon('copy')}复制文案</button></div><div class="evidence-card" style="margin-top:21px"><div class="evidence-head"><strong>这段文案引用了什么？</strong><span class="tag green">有示例事实依据</span></div><p class="evidence-note">评论分类项目：使用 Python 整理反馈、归纳问题并输出结果表。到岗条件来自当前个人档案。</p></div><div class="info-note">${icon('info')}<span>文案不会自动发送。请先核实个人事实与到岗条件，再到原平台完成沟通；随后手动标记投递状态。</span></div>`}
function setGreetingStyle(id,v){greetingStyle=v;job(id).greeting=makeGreeting(job(id),v);save();openJob(id,'greeting')}
function saveGreeting(id){const el=document.getElementById('greeting-text');if(!el?.value.trim()){toast('请先填写文案');return}job(id).greeting=el.value.trim();addHistory('已保存沟通文案',`${job(id).company} · 投递状态未改变`);toast('文案已保存，投递状态未改变。')}
function regenerateGreeting(id){job(id).greeting=makeGreeting(job(id),greetingStyle);addHistory('已重新生成文案演示',job(id).company);openJob(id,'greeting');toast('已重新生成示例草稿，请核实后使用。')}
async function copyGreeting(id){const text=document.getElementById('greeting-text')?.value||job(id).greeting||makeGreeting(job(id));try{if(navigator.clipboard?.writeText)await navigator.clipboard.writeText(text);else{const t=document.createElement('textarea');t.value=text;document.body.append(t);t.select();const ok=document.execCommand('copy');t.remove();if(!ok)throw Error('copy failed')}job(id).greeting=text;addHistory('已复制招呼语',`${job(id).company} · 需用户在原平台投递`);toast('已复制。请在原平台投递后，回来更新状态。')}catch{toast('复制未完成，请选择文案并手动复制。')}}
function recordDetail(j){const events=state.history.filter(h=>h.detail.includes(j.company));return `<div class="section-head"><h2>当前申请状态</h2>${statusTag(j.status)}</div><div class="confirmation-list"><div><small>投递日期</small>${j.date||'尚未记录'}</div><div><small>记录方式</small>由用户手动更新</div></div><div class="field" style="margin-top:19px"><label>申请备注</label><textarea class="input" id="record-note" placeholder="例如：已投递，等待反馈；或记录面试安排">${esc(j.note||'')}</textarea></div><div class="inline" style="margin-top:13px"><button class="button soft" onclick="saveNote(${j.id})">保存备注</button><button class="button" onclick="openStatusModal([${j.id}])">修改申请状态</button><button class="button" onclick="manualApply(${j.id})">${icon('external')}原平台投递入口</button></div><div class="info-note">${icon('info')}<span>${j.manual?'使用你提供的来源链接前往原平台。链接尚未核验，打开网页不会自动标记已投递。':'示例岗位不提供真实投递链接。打开原平台不会自动标记已投递。'}</span></div><div class="section-head"><h2>岗位活动记录</h2></div><div class="timeline">${events.length?events.map(h=>`<div class="timeline-item">${esc(h.title)}<small>${esc(h.time)}</small><div style="font-size:10px">${esc(h.detail)}</div></div>`).join(''):'<div class="timeline-item">岗位已加入示例岗位池<small>暂无进一步操作记录</small></div>'}</div>`}
function manualApply(id){toast('这是示例岗位，没有真实投递链接。正式版本将在此打开来源平台。')}
function saveNote(id){const val=document.getElementById('record-note')?.value||'';job(id).note=val.trim();addHistory('已更新岗位备注',`${job(id).company} · ${val.trim().slice(0,50)}`);toast('备注已保存')}
function openStatusModal(ids){ids=ids.filter(id=>job(id));if(!ids.length){toast('请先选择岗位');return}modal='status';const first=job(ids[0]);showModal(`${modalHead(ids.length>1?`更新 ${ids.length} 个岗位的状态`:'更新申请进度',ids.length>1?'批量更新将应用到所选岗位。':first.company+' · '+first.title)}<form onsubmit="submitStatus(event,${JSON.stringify(ids)})"><div class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label>申请状态</label><select class="select" name="status" onchange="document.getElementById('status-date-field').style.opacity=this.value==='pending'||this.value==='ignored'?'.5':'1'">${Object.entries(statuses).map(([v,n])=>`<option value="${v}" ${v===(ids.length>1?'applied':first.status)?'selected':''}>${n}</option>`).join('')}</select></div><div class="field" id="status-date-field"><label>投递日期</label><input type="date" class="input" name="date" value="${first.date||today()}"></div><div class="field wide"><label>备注${ids.length>1?'（留空则保留原备注）':''}</label><textarea class="input" name="note" maxlength="500" placeholder="记录当前情况或下一步安排">${ids.length===1?esc(first.note||''):''}</textarea></div></div><div class="info-note">${icon('info')}<span>请选择实际已经完成的阶段。状态修改只更新本工作台记录，不会向招聘方发送任何信息。</span></div><div class="footer"><button class="button" type="button" onclick="closeOverlay()">取消</button><button class="button primary" type="submit">${icon('check')}保存状态</button></div></form>`)}
function submitStatus(e,ids){e.preventDefault();const f=new FormData(e.target),s=f.get('status'),date=f.get('date'),note=String(f.get('note')||'');if(['applied','interview','ended'].includes(s)&&!date){toast('请填写实际投递日期');return}if(updateStatus(ids,s,date,note)){closeOverlay();render();toast(`已更新 ${ids.length} 个岗位为“${statuses[s]}”`,true)}}
function bulkStatus(s){const ids=selectedVisibleJobs().map(j=>j.id);if(!ids.length)return;if(updateStatus(ids,s)){render();toast(`已将 ${ids.length} 个岗位标记为${statuses[s]}`,true)}}
function undoLast(){if(!lastUndo){toast('没有可撤销的修改');return}const previous=structuredClone(state),undo=lastUndo;if(undo.kind==='saved'){undo.changes.forEach(old=>{const j=job(old.id);if(!j)return;j.saved=old.saved;if(old.savedAt===undefined)delete j.savedAt;else j.savedAt=old.savedAt});if(!addHistory('已撤销收藏修改',undo.changes.map(old=>job(old.id)?.company).join('、'))){state=previous;return}lastUndo=null;refreshCollections();toast('已恢复修改前的收藏，投递状态未改变。');return}const names=undo.jobs.map(j=>j.company).join('、');undo.jobs.forEach(old=>{const j=job(old.id);if(j)for(const k of ['status','date','note']){if(old[k]===undefined)delete j[k];else j[k]=old[k]}});if(!addHistory('已撤销投递状态修改',names)){state=previous;return}lastUndo=null;render();toast('已恢复修改前的状态。')}
function openSearch(){modal='global-search';showModal(`${modalHead('搜索你的岗位','按岗位名称、公司或技能关键词检索。')}<input class="input" style="width:100%" placeholder="例如：运营、SQL、星屿" id="global-query" aria-label="搜索关键词" oninput="showSearchResults(this.value)"><div class="search-results" id="global-results"></div>`);showSearchResults('')}
function showSearchResults(q){const a=state.jobs.filter(j=>(j.title+j.company+j.tags.join('')).toLowerCase().includes(q.toLowerCase())).slice(0,7);document.getElementById('global-results').innerHTML=a.length?a.map(j=>`<button onclick="openJob(${j.id})">${esc(j.title)}<small>${j.company} · ${j.city} · ${statuses[j.status]}</small></button>`).join(''):'<div class="empty" style="padding:25px"><h3>没有找到相关岗位</h3><p>换个关键词试试。</p></div>'}
function openNotices(){showModal(`${modalHead('你的待办','围绕当前档案与岗位的下一步。')}<div class="evidence-item"><strong>SQL 能力信息 ${state.profile.sql?'已补充':'待补充'}</strong><small>影响星屿科技、知序数据的相关判断</small><br><button class="link-btn" onclick="askPreset('我想补充 SQL 能力信息',1)">和助手补充 →</button></div><div class="evidence-item"><strong>查看面试中的岗位</strong><small>轻舟智能 · AI 应用运营实习生</small><br><button class="link-btn" onclick="openJob(7,'record')">查看申请记录 →</button></div><div class="footer"><button class="button" onclick="closeOverlay()">关闭</button><button class="button soft" onclick="closeOverlay();nav('applications')">查看所有进度</button></div>`)}
function openVersions(){const a=state.versions||[];showModal(`${modalHead('个人档案历史','只保留当前浏览器内最近 8 次更新。')}${a.length?`<div class="timeline">${a.map((v,i)=>`<div class="timeline-item">${esc(v.time)}<small>${esc(v.profile.city)} · ${v.profile.days} 天/周 · ${esc(v.profile.direction)}</small><button class="link-btn" onclick="restoreVersion(${i})">恢复此版本</button></div>`).join('')}</div>`:'<div class="empty" style="padding:30px"><h3>还没有历史版本</h3><p>保存档案修改或确认新证据后，会在这里保留旧版本。</p></div>'}<div class="footer"><button class="button" onclick="closeOverlay()">关闭</button></div>`)}
function restoreVersion(i){const old=state.versions?.[i];if(!old)return;const previous=structuredClone(state),current=structuredClone(state.profile);state.profile=structuredClone(old.profile);syncExperienceFlags();state.versions.splice(i,1);state.versions.unshift({profile:current,time:nowLabel()});if(!addHistory('已恢复个人档案历史版本',`${state.profile.city} · 每周 ${state.profile.days} 天`)){state=previous;return}closeOverlay();render();toast('档案已恢复，条件判断已重新计算。')}
function openReset(){showModal(`${modalHead('恢复初始演示数据？','本次操作会清除当前演示账号内的档案编辑、收藏、文案、消息和状态修改。其他账号不受影响。')}<div class="info-note">${icon('info')}<span>仅影响此浏览器里的 InternPilot 演示数据，不涉及真实招聘账号。</span></div><div class="footer"><button class="button" onclick="closeOverlay()">取消</button><button class="button danger" onclick="resetDemo()">确认重置</button></div>`)}
function resetDemo(){manualJobDraft=null;resetExperienceUi();clearInterval(taskTimer);task={running:false,step:0,status:'idle'};state=fresh();lastUndo=null;chatContext=null;selected.clear();save();closeOverlay();nav('dashboard');toast('已恢复示例数据')}
document.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(typeof accountSessionReady==='function'&&!accountSessionReady())return;if(e.key==='Escape'){closeOverlay();toggleChat(false);document.querySelector('.sidebar')?.classList.remove('open')}if((e.metaKey||e.ctrlKey)&&e.key.toLowerCase()==='k'){e.preventDefault();openSearch()}if(e.key==='Tab'&&document.querySelector('[role="dialog"]')){const dialog=document.querySelector('[role="dialog"]');const a=[...dialog.querySelectorAll('button,input,select,textarea,a[href]')].filter(el=>!el.disabled&&el.offsetParent!==null);if(a.length){const first=a[0],last=a[a.length-1];if(e.shiftKey&&document.activeElement===first){e.preventDefault();last.focus()}else if(!e.shiftKey&&document.activeElement===last){e.preventDefault();first.focus()}}}});
